    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSITE FOR SALE:\n\nA unique opportunity to acquire a site located in the heart of Dalkey. The site previously had Planning Permission (which has now lapsed) for the demolition on an existing single-storey cottage, and the construction of a new 1.5 storey three-bedroom detached residence comprising, kitchen, living/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms (main en-suite & dressing area) family bathroom and private garden. \n\nSituated in the heart of the Dalkey, 10 Corrig Road is convenient to a myriad of specialty shops, restaurants, bars and the wonderful scenic walks afforded by Dalkey and Killiney Hills. The Dart station and bus service at Dalkey is close by, and there is excellent shopping at nearby Sandycove, Glasthule and Dun Laoghaire. There is also a selection of well-regarded schools within walking distance including Loreto NS, Loreto Abbey, Harold's Boys, Castlepark School, Rathdown, Holy Child Killiney and St. Joseph of Cluny.\n\nFor full planning documentation please see: \n\nPlanning Register Reference: 303448 (An Bord Pleanála)\nPlanning Permission Granted: 17th April 2019\nExpiry date: 17 April 2024"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>- Lapsed planning permission for a detached residence extending to 138sq.m / 1,485 sq.ft approx. </li><li>- .068 an acre</li><li>- Superb Dalkey location walking distance to Dart, shops and bus </li><li>- Excellent schools in the vicinity</ul>"
      },
